{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b4d909930188e11dc779056436648e88de04b1a4e65f8af7828e2b7b5e1c9502", "ja": "（ついに千鶴さんの、\n765プロ劇場での初公演が始まる）", "zh": "（千鹤在765艺能剧场的\n首次公演终于要开始了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6bdb215f3cbcee55992b3185275f6e9e26b551e3210062a1d60235bff2d0290a", "ja": "（千鶴さんのことだ、緊張してないと思うけど……\n一応、様子を見てこよう）", "zh": "（千鹤这么厉害的人，应该不会紧张才对……\n不过还是去看看她的状况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "ef6752629bbe6b69926dcfb674cf6ab27af7a8b8c9b0743eba8b75d6655789d4", "ja": "あれだけ練習したんですもの、大丈夫ですわ。\n必ず……必ず、うまくいきますわ。", "zh": "都做了那么多练习，没问题的。\n一定……一定会顺利的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "1a863c117f474a51b0f64643496b2691c302d0731d9a08b7ebb8774c1095769e", "ja": "すぅー……はぁー……すぅー…………。", "zh": "（吸气……吐气……吸气…………）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1a11d75fb9dc9d41ac7932d9969e00313be802b8cf4fed4f9b285600a369597f", "ja": "千鶴さん？", "zh": "千鹤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "312fee27aa268ff36f270dc1a9a0e5052603cdae6093d8513396dd5b65e5ce3a", "ja": "きゃああっ！？　……{$P$}！？\n突然、何事ですの！？", "zh": "呀啊啊！？\n……{$P$}！？你怎么突然冒出来！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b6b8a0a84f765cc3a7545fe8ce268ade55903968ff261e6032de381bdf0f9ec0", "ja": "あっ、すみません。公演がそろそろ始まるので、\n千鶴さんの様子を見に来たんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，不好意思。因为公演就快要开始了，\n我来看看千鹤你的状况如何……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "5afa27adce8ee9fd127506d399d87870568a1b2a8a850d91d52c2be393ed6b8d", "ja": "あ、あら、そうでしたの。わたくしとしたことが、\n驚きのあまり取り乱してしまいましたわ……。", "zh": "是、是吗？原来是这样。本小姐也太不像话了，\n居然被吓得乱了方寸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e5a8828065805e317f3a96040922d51004cbb437f5271b2c79849537b82f2291", "ja": "いえ、俺こそ後ろから声をかけてしまって……。\nそれより、調子はどうですか？", "zh": "不，是我不该从背后突然叫住你的……\n先别说这些，你的状况还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "a19738d391f4ff7c02afcb183f43e13f6c544cb0f7a239a824dc421fa3ac8a4c", "ja": "も、もちろん万全でしてよ！\nノドの調子もいいですし、体調も良好ですわっ。", "zh": "当、当然是准备万全呀！\n喉咙的状况不错，身体状况也很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "27b2b482f2648803af4ba43ac38ce4c98a846d7099f2046a7cc938104a8dcb0c", "ja": "そうですか！　よかった。\nせっかくの初舞台ですしね。", "zh": "是吗！太好了。\n毕竟这是你宝贵的首次登台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "6254f7208baefa5022bf2adb9f75e5f2121b39aa354a4cb1268f510c5ff5e9c0", "ja": "ええ！　ははは、は、はつ、初舞台だなんて、\nそんなことちっとも気にしていませんし！", "zh": "是啊！首首首、首、首次、首次登台，\n本小姐一点都不紧张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "db41b131553b9017fb017b0116d1df59ec00cba19cb44b8841cf84415ebf7a43", "ja": "必ずや、{$P$}の\n期待以上のものを見せて差し上げますわっ！", "zh": "一定会让{$P$}看到\n超乎期待的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "fada9c2c3e90b839151c2d9affdb63073e317bd193457d06fe6c7e837ac2d098", "ja": "お、おーーーっほっほっほ……ゴホッ、ケホッ。\n……はぁ。", "zh": "哦、哦──呵呵呵……咳咳、咳咳。\n……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "41541a4315c0b6112c14527bac4d0fa8db7dee394553b8d49a5e722060d1ba79", "ja": "千鶴さん……。そうか、心配なんですね。\n何と言っても、今日が初舞台ですし……。", "zh": "千鹤……我知道了，你一定很担心吧。\n毕竟今天是你首次登台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "f99b6d9cf0676b09980d097b8c59b78707c25c3de8bffdb9e4d6aff181b8c7e4", "ja": "し、心配？\nいったい、何の話ですの？", "zh": "担、担心？\n你究竟在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "00e12fd646da555eda78fec8dcb0bb11ab2e6661a2eae6241c84418e95044689", "ja": "わたくし、何も心配などしていませんわ！\nお…、おーっほっほ…。", "zh": "本小姐怎么会担心呢！？\n哦……哦～呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9f64abd3a947b2395eae8675f74ee08f5b73b4492e7bbdf8e135663e824c6aba", "ja": "気を使わなくても大丈夫です。\n確かに、もっと早く心配すべきでした。この……。", "zh": "你不用顾虑我没关系的。\n的确，我应该更早考量到这一点的。这间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_1018", "source_sha256": "0952079d4df1d1f81a773f0fd4ed79740307ae3a804b02a8395b6d390f6994c0", "ja": "この劇場の小ささを", "zh": "这间剧场太小了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "da907735092626c89f5886237652d4bd18d68be20eb98f4c5f0a2659335f49bc", "ja": "この劇場の小ささを……！", "zh": "这间剧场太小了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2001_038chz", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "97e1f8ad7d87adbbb2df519ffb0e258127c093472936c4f5b42221904d6cc6b6", "ja": "こんな小さな劇場で、本当に千鶴さんの輝きを\n受け止めきれるのか。心配して当然です。", "zh": "剧场这么小，任谁都会怀疑这里能否承受千鹤的光芒，\n你会担心也是人之常情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2003_038chz", "source_sha256": "2f251229ece0f14dc64b416b51d02c12a8b0ad657aadac9d109dc8cca3503215", "ja": "い、いえあの、わたくしは別に決して、\nそんなことは……。", "zh": "不、不是的、本小姐\n从来没那样想过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "bb20acb6f5ae2a6535e62a0b99175e6dde69b262ca42c1ea71c4f267f112f106", "ja": "確かに千鶴さんの輝きは、大きな舞台でこそ真価を\n発揮すると思います。でも……大丈夫です。", "zh": "的确，我也认为千鹤的光芒要在\n大舞台上才能发挥出真正的价值。不过……请你放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2005_p", "source_sha256": "34f72dd54e3f7c1fdc178ec44fdc75bf4a7f3dda86ddc05becd98d47614a1646", "ja": "どんな舞台でも、千鶴さんの輝きは変わりません。\nむしろ小さいからこそ、強く輝けると思います！", "zh": "无论在怎样的舞台上，千鹤的光芒都是不变的。\n况且我认为在小场地反倒能绽放出更强的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2007_p", "source_sha256": "7b87ad70c63eed4150bbf5a0d843dad7461ee1924504dd3be94b9694b9babfb9", "ja": "これはまだ、最初の一歩です。\nだから……。", "zh": "现在还只是跨出第一步而已。\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2008_038chz", "source_sha256": "2c8d02e2d61d6c7c98ddff84c3d210c0918c6bd1c73c3f001376a113b2e85fc3", "ja": "……ええ。\nええ、そうでしたわね。", "zh": "……是啊。\n没错，你说得对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2009_038chz", "source_sha256": "a706d19b6826a13c95693d040d8bfba1392a7d96626708a1d191e1a121139d4a", "ja": "どんな場所でも、わたくしはわたくし……。\n今のわたくしの成果を、お見せすればいいだけですわ。", "zh": "不管在什么地方，本小姐就是本小姐……\n尽管展现出本小姐至今获得的成果就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2010_p", "source_sha256": "cf50b924113b1acfc110f406e81971995a8461a6b17db799bf32ab0e83f39892", "ja": "いつか必ず、大きな舞台に立たせてみせます。\nだから、まずはここからスタートしましょう！", "zh": "总有一天我一定会让你站上大舞台的。\n所以，先从这里起步吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2011_038chz", "source_sha256": "5aa128771174030f7414140514f8e6c53efe134cf739cb171a54d1ba4be9f30d", "ja": "ふふっ……わかりましたわ。\nその頼もしい言葉、しかと胸に留めておきます。", "zh": "呵呵……本小姐明白了。\n你这段令人信赖的话，本小姐会好好记在心里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2012_038chz", "source_sha256": "8da2ede47a514dfd830d3c04a23008ad3dddee590a68a2b4c3648c5933920efb", "ja": "それでは、{$P$}。\n今日までのわたくしの成果を……。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}。\n本小姐至今为止的成果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2013_038chz", "source_sha256": "f1f82b096d0ba7daac1ff4d350d149548153a43163f2f1f98ee3cde2f1a61004", "ja": "輝ける晴れ舞台を、\nその目にしっかりと焼き付けてくださいまし！", "zh": "绽放光芒的重要舞台，\n请你睁大眼睛看清楚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_038chz_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "eb6d311ee180656fe22ba1aba09970d9ece693af24c12c754c20729ee5fefe2b", "ja": "（千鶴さんは胸を張り、歩き出す。\nその先はきっと、光り輝く未来へと続いているだろう）", "zh": "（千鹤挺起胸膛，向前迈步。\n她迈向的一定是光明灿烂的未来吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
